function goToSrFromOtherPages(data){if(data!=undefined){var jsonData={source:"",requestType:"",topic:"",orderCode:"",entryNumber:"",poNumber:"",itemNo:"",status:"",partNumber:"",orderQuantity:"",orderNetPrice:"",priority:"",subject:"",customerCode:"",quoteOrigExpDate:"",uom:""};if(data.source!=""){jsonData.source=data.source;}else{jsonData.source=undefined;}
if(data.requestType!=""){jsonData.requestType=data.requestType;}else{jsonData.requestType=undefined;}
if(data.topic!=""){jsonData.topic=data.topic;}else{jsonData.topic=undefined;}
if(data.orderCode!=""){jsonData.orderCode=data.orderCode;}else{jsonData.orderCode=undefined;}
if(data.entryNumber!=""){jsonData.entryNumber=data.entryNumber;}else{jsonData.entryNumber=undefined;}
if(data.poNumber!=""){jsonData.poNumber=data.poNumber;}else{jsonData.poNumber=undefined;}
if(data.itemNo!=""){jsonData.itemNo=data.itemNo;}else{jsonData.itemNo=undefined;}
if(data.status!=""){jsonData.status=data.status;}else{jsonData.status=undefined;}
if(data.partNumber!=""){jsonData.partNumber=window.atob(data.partNumber);}else{jsonData.partNumber=undefined;}
if(data.orderQuantity!=""){jsonData.orderQuantity=data.orderQuantity;}else{jsonData.orderQuantity=undefined;}
if(data.orderNetPrice!=""&&data.orderNetPrice!="0.00"&&data.orderNetPrice!="FREE OF CHARGE"){jsonData.orderNetPrice=data.orderNetPrice;}else{jsonData.orderNetPrice=undefined;}
if(data.priority!=""){jsonData.priority=data.priority;}else{jsonData.priority=undefined;}
if(data.subject!=""){jsonData.subject=data.subject;}else{jsonData.subject=undefined;}
if(data.customerCode!=""){jsonData.customerCode=data.customerCode;}else{jsonData.customerCode=undefined;}
if(data.quoteOrigExpDate!=""){jsonData.quoteOrigExpDate=data.quoteOrigExpDate;}else{jsonData.quoteOrigExpDate=undefined;}
if(data.uom!=""){jsonData.uom=data.uom;}else{jsonData.uom=undefined;}
if(data.freeOfChargeFlag!=""){jsonData.freeOfChargeFlag=data.freeOfChargeFlag;}else{jsonData.freeOfChargeFlag=undefined;}
if(data.hybrisOrderType!=""){jsonData.hybrisOrderType=data.hybrisOrderType;}else{jsonData.hybrisOrderType=undefined;}
store.set('srData',{});store.set('srData',jsonData);var srData=store.get('srData');if(srData!=undefined&&(srData.source!="ORDER_SEARCH_RESULTS"||srData.source!="ORDER_DETAILS_PAGE")&&srData.topic!="RETURN"){window.location.href=ACC.config.contextPath+"/supports/add-support-ticket";}else if(isSingaporeReturn){var proformaNumber=(data&&data.proforma)?data.proforma:null;var shipmentNumber=(data&&data.shipmentNumber)?data.shipmentNumber:"";var itemCategory=(data&&data.itemCategory)?data.itemCategory:"";var storageLocation=(data&&data.storageLocation)?data.storageLocation:"";var outboundDelivery=(data&&data.outboundDelivery)?data.outboundDelivery:"";var sapOrderType=(data&&data.sapOrderType)?data.sapOrderType:"";var shipStore=(data&&data.shipStore)?data.shipStore:null;var shipToAccount=(data&&data.shipToAccount)?data.shipToAccount:"";localStorage.setItem('proformaNumber',proformaNumber);localStorage.setItem('shipmentNumber',shipmentNumber);localStorage.setItem('itemCategory',itemCategory);localStorage.setItem('storageLocation',storageLocation);localStorage.setItem('outboundDelivery',outboundDelivery);getEligibleWarehouses(jsonData.partNumber,true,itemCategory,storageLocation,sapOrderType,shipStore,shipToAccount);}else{window.location.href=ACC.config.contextPath+'/return/returnpage';}}}
